ntrant __eq__ that advances the grouper finds the value gone: gh-146613's"] [408 3 "// test_grouper_reentrant_eq_does_not_crash)"] [512 3 "// islice_next: next capped at stop as it grows, so that a huge step cannot run past it"] [562 3 "// pairwise_next: the old item read before the next one is asked for, so a re-entrant call that changes the"] [563 3 "// state between does not change this pair (queue 328: test_pairwise_reenter)"] [647 3 "// strict is keyword-only (batched(iterable, n, *, strict=False); queue 328)"] [693 2 "// the combinatorics, over the pools' items (each pool read once, as CPython)"] [909 1 "// itertoolsTee is tee(iterable, n=2) (itertools_tee_impl): the first iterator tee_fromiterable's of iter(iterable),"] [910 1 "// the others its copies (queue 328: a tee's tee is a new one, gh-123884's independent objects)."] [947 1 "// teeFromIterable is tee_fromiterable: a tee's copy when iter(o) is a tee, else the first cursor over a new buffer of"] [948 1 "// its items (_tee(iterable) too)."] [964 30 "// tee_copy: another cursor over the same data"] [971 18 "// teedataobject_getitem"] [1013 2 "// itertools._tee(iterable) (queue 328: \"tee object should be instantiable\")"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[59 41] [85 41] [116 28] [117 29] [135 32] [175 30] [210 52] [224 30] [252 47] [255 62] [270 30] [283 32] [340 30] [418 45] [471 33] [493 35] [497 35] [500 35] [504 35] [551 35] [583 34] [648 30] [664 33] [726 13] [726 25] [739 9] [739 17] [796 14] [796 21] [809 18] [809 26] [865 10] [865 39] [872 16] [872 23] [877 9] [877 40] [884 19] [884 26] [912 34] [915 39] [921 32] [941 12] [941 19] [954 27] [994 22]]} (go/file "builtins_itertools.go" :imports [])

